###Text
Text test::emeraldmarsh4::doc::MarshNotes
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# Marsh Nest Register\n\nNest reports arrive as nested documents. A first model-to-model stage standardises each report, folding the depth ladder, kind and egg stage codes through enumeration lookups over computed expressions and splitting observers through a union. A second stage, reached through a chaining connection, qualifies each standardised nest with boolean helper functions.\n';
}
